OL,3,GNEWSAFenced-in woman angered by new
OL,4,A'Lego' blocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has described a council as "a
OL,7,Flaw unto themselves" after it placed
OL,8,Fadditional concrete blocks near an
OL,9,Fentrance to her property.
OL,11,FHelene Ball, who lives on George Road
OL,12,Fin Matlock, won a three-year legal
OL,13,Fbattle against Derbyshire County
OL,14,FCouncil after it fenced-off a gap in
OL,15,Fher garden wall, and secured the
OL,16,Festablishment of a right of way and
OL,17,F#50,000 in costs from the authority.
OL,19,FBut she said two further "concrete Lego
OL,20,Fbricks" had been placed on the grass
OL,21,Fverge outside her gate after the
OL,22,Fverdict.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
