OL,3,GNEWSAFenced-in woman angered by new
OL,4,A'Lego' blocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands the two additional
OL,7,Fblocks have been placed to protect the
OL,8,Fgrassed area and trees from
OL,9,Funauthorised parking and damage once
OL,10,Fthe car park entrance is opened.
